            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A tandem crossover-annulation and oxygenation process of conjugated enediyne-acids and ortho-alkynylanilines was achieved by palladium-copper relay catalysis under an oxygen atmosphere, giving access to the three-component assembly of 9-acylphenanthridine compounds.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
